#ASSERT `the document may be served on an individual in this way` `posting it to the place of residence or a place of business of the individual last known to the server` FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `the document may be served on an individual in this way` `posting it to the place of residence or a place of business of the individual last known to the server` TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
