#ASSERT `the document may be served on a body corporate in this way` `leaving it at the registered office of the body corporate` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `the document may be served on a body corporate in this way` `posting it to the registered office of the body corporate` FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `the document may be served on a body corporate in this way` `leaving it at another physical address designated by the body corporate for the service of documents of that kind` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `the document may be served on a body corporate in this way` `leaving it at another physical address designated by the body corporate for the service of documents of that kind` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `the document may be served on a body corporate in this way` `posting it to another physical address designated by the body corporate for the service of documents of that kind` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `the document may be served on a body corporate in this way` `posting it to another physical address designated by the body corporate for the service of documents of that kind` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `the document may be served on a body corporate in this way` `leaving it at a place of business of the body corporate last known to the server` FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `the document may be served on a body corporate in this way` `leaving it at a place of business of the body corporate last known to the server` TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `the document may be served on a body corporate in this way` `posting it to a place of business of the body corporate last known to the server` FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `the document may be served on a body corporate in this way` `posting it to a place of business of the body corporate last known to the server` TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `the document may be served on a body corporate in this way` `sending it electronically to the body corporate in a manner designated, or agreed to, by the body corporate for the service of documents of that kind` FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `the document may be served on a body corporate in this way` `another way of serving a body corporate` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `a document is posted to an address` TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `a document is posted to an address` FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `a document is posted to an address` TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `a document is posted to an address` TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `the form used is sufficient` TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
